sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(cluster-proxy)<br/>8443/TCP
    participant Prom as prometheus-operated<br/>9090/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS 1.2+

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Metrics Query Path (Cluster-Wide)
    Client->>Route: GET /api/v1/query<br/>HTTPS, Bearer Token
    Route->>KRBP: Forward (TLS re-encrypt)<br/>8443/TCP
    KRBP->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>(system:auth-delegator)
    K8sAPI-->>KRBP: Token Valid
    KRBP->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(metrics.k8s.io/nodes:get)
    K8sAPI-->>KRBP: Authorized
    KRBP->>Prom: Proxy Request<br/>mTLS (client cert + CA)
    Prom-->>KRBP: Metrics Response
    KRBP-->>Route: Encrypted Response
    Route-->>Client: JSON Metrics

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Metrics Query Path (Namespace-Scoped)
    participant NSProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(namespace-proxy)<br/>8443/TCP

    Client->>Route: GET /api/v1/query?namespace=X<br/>HTTPS, Bearer Token
    Route->>NSProxy: Forward (TLS re-encrypt)<br/>8443/TCP
    NSProxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>(system:auth-delegator)
    K8sAPI-->>NSProxy: Token Valid
    NSProxy->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(metrics.k8s.io/pods, namespace=X)
    K8sAPI-->>NSProxy: Authorized
    NSProxy->>Prom: Proxy Request<br/>(namespace param rewritten)
    Prom-->>NSProxy: Namespace-Scoped Metrics
    NSProxy-->>Route: Encrypted Response
    Route-->>Client: JSON Metrics

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Reconciliation Flow
    participant Operator as MonitoringReconciler
    participant APIServer as OpenShift APIServer
    participant Deployer as odh-platform-utilities<br/>Deployer

    Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch Monitoring CR<br/>+ 15 resource types
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Reconcile Event
    Operator->>APIServer: Read TLSSecurityProfile
    APIServer-->>Operator: TLS Config<br/>(ciphers, min version)
    Operator->>Deployer: Render Go Templates<br/>(with TLS settings)
    Deployer-->>Operator: Rendered Manifests
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply<br/>(deterministic ordering)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Applied

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Webhook Injection
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS

    K8sAPI->>Webhook: PodMonitor/ServiceMonitor<br/>CREATE/UPDATE
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Resource<br/>(labels injected)
